%% Request sequence — happy path on LangGraph
sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant G as Gateway
  participant O as Orchestrator_LangGraph
  participant A as ContextAssembler
  participant S as Store_and_Registry
  participant L as LLM_Tools
  C->>G: Authenticated request
  G->>O: invoke or Command resume thread_id
  O->>A: Assemble context
  A->>S: Store search + skill resolve + episodes
  S-->>A: Hits and manifests
  A-->>O: ContextPackage
  O->>L: Model and tool step
  L-->>O: Results
  Note over O: Checkpointer auto-saves
  O-->>C: Progress or interrupt
